@startuml
title UML State Machine Diagram

state RegisterLogin <<choice>>
state TeacherStudentChoice <<choice>>

[*] --> RegisterLogin

RegisterLogin --> LoginSuccess : details provided
LoginSuccess --> TeacherStudentChoice : continue as teacher or student

TeacherStudentChoice --> TeacherChoice : continue as teacher
TeacherChoice --> CreateQuiz : create new quiz
TeacherChoice --> EditQuiz : edit existing quiz
TeacherChoice --> SaveDraftPost : save as draft or post
TeacherChoice --> ViewResults : view quiz results

TeacherChoice --> ExitSystem : exit system

TeacherChoice --> TeacherChoice

RegisterLogin --> StudentChoice : continue as student
StudentChoice --> SelectQuiz : select a quiz
StudentChoice --> AnswerQuiz : answer selected quiz
StudentChoice --> SubmitQuiz : submit quiz after answering
StudentChoice --> ViewResult : view result after submitting

StudentChoice --> ExitSystem : exit system

@enduml
